<Base title="Privacy">
  <h1>Privacy</h1>
  <p>This website is static. It sets no cookies, runs no analytics, and loads nothing from third parties. The hosting provider (GitHub Pages) keeps standard access logs under its own policy.</p>
  <p>The Agent Guard CLI sends no telemetry. It uses the network only when you pass an opt-in flag, and every report lists which network features were used and which hosts were contacted.</p>
</Base>
